@startuml diagramme_classes_pedagogie
!theme plain
skinparam dpi 300
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
hide circle
hide empty members

title Diagramme de classes — Structure pédagogique et groupes

abstract class AuditableEntity {
  +UUID id
  +Instant createdAt
  +Instant updatedAt
}

class User {
  +String email
  +String fullName
  +Role role
  +boolean enabled
  +boolean year2AccessEnabled
}

class LearnerGroup {
  +String name
  +String code
  +LocalDate startDate
  +LocalDate endDate
  +EnrollmentMode enrollmentMode
}

class GroupContentAssignment {
  +String ufCode
  +Instant unlockAt
}

class Formation {
  +String title
  +boolean published
}

class ModuleEntity {
  +String code
  +String title
  +int orderIndex
  +int yearNumber
  +String ufCode
  +String ufTitle
  +boolean published
}

class Lesson {
  +String title
  +int orderIndex
  +boolean published
}

class LessonBlock {
  +BlockType blockType
  +Map content
  +int orderIndex
}

class LessonProgress {
  +double videoWatchedPercent
  +boolean completed
  +Instant completedAt
}

AuditableEntity <|-- User
AuditableEntity <|-- LearnerGroup
AuditableEntity <|-- GroupContentAssignment
AuditableEntity <|-- Formation
AuditableEntity <|-- ModuleEntity
AuditableEntity <|-- Lesson
AuditableEntity <|-- LessonBlock
AuditableEntity <|-- LessonProgress

User "0..N" -- "0..1" LearnerGroup : membre >
LearnerGroup "1" *-- "0..N" GroupContentAssignment
GroupContentAssignment "0..N" --> "1" ModuleEntity

Formation "1" *-- "0..N" ModuleEntity
ModuleEntity "1" *-- "0..N" Lesson
Lesson "1" *-- "0..N" LessonBlock
User "1" -- "0..N" LessonProgress
Lesson "1" -- "0..N" LessonProgress

note bottom of ModuleEntity
  L'Unité de Formation (UF) et l'année ne sont **pas**
  des entités séparées : ce sont des attributs
  (ufCode/ufTitle, yearNumber) portés directement par
  ModuleEntity (choix de modèle volontaire, voir ch. 2).
end note

@enduml
